      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "From the outset, it was clear that Daniel was passionate about solar energy, his customer relationships and focus on a quality electrical installation. Not for him any slick sales gimmicks or incentives, just a thoroughly professional, considered and helpful approach to dealing with the many queries we raised as potential solar customers. His installation team were similarly enthusiastic, conscientious and tidy in their demeanor and approach to the actual installation. Throughout the process, Daniel maintained regular contact, advising on next steps and responding to any last minute queries. The system we chose was good value for money with flexibility in our choice of componentry and Daniel handled all the supplier paperwork on our behalf. The Spark proposal also included regular system follow up and cleaning, which we considered to be a valuable feature of their offer.All in all, an extremely satisfactory experience and we would have no hesitation in recommending Daniel and his efficient Spark Innovation team to anyone seeking a high quality, PV electrical installation.",
